  "description": "Being stranded on an island with the five hot male leads of an erotic novel? That sounds like many women's dream... Except, when you've reincarnated as the villainess that all said hotties hate with a burning passion, it's closer to a nightmare. And that's without even counting the monsters that roam the island! As a former scout instructor, Margaret can handle the wilderness, but she never learned how to deal with buff men with homicidal tendencies. Let's just hope she can take the heat!\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
